target/
**/node_modules/
ui/dist/
# Local env files carry real secrets (e.g. ECAA_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY). Never bake
# them into the image layer via `COPY . .`. The tracked .env.example template is
# fine but the image doesn't need it either; runtime config comes from the
# process environment (compose `environment:` / `env_file:`), not a baked file.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Exclude local docs but KEEP docs/ecaa-spec — core::emitter::ecaa and
# conversation::emit::validation include_str! the subgraph schemas at compile time.
docs/*
!docs/ecaa-spec
runtime/
.venv-validator/
.playwright-mcp/
.pytest_cache/
.worktrees/
*.log
# .cargo/config.toml forces host-only tools (rustc-wrapper=sccache, -fuse-ld=mold)
# that aren't in the build image; cargo-chef also bakes it into recipe.json. Exclude it
# so the container build uses the default rustc + linker. The remap-path-prefix it sets
# is for cross-checkout binary parity (moot in a fixed /app build) and does not affect
# the emitted-package reproducibility gate.
.cargo/
